## Week 2: Group Roles and Dataset Exploration

### My Role
Data and Backend Developer

### Work Completed
- Discussed and agreed on each group member’s role and responsibilities.
- Took responsibility for dataset selection and data preparation.
- Searched Kaggle for CSV datasets suitable for our sales analytics project.
- Downloaded and compared different datasets.
- Imported the datasets into Orange to explore their columns and data types.
- Checked for missing values and whether the datasets contained the information needed for our project.
- Discussed dataset options with the team and selected the SalesInsight online retail dataset.

### Challenges
Some datasets did not contain the sales information needed for our planned features. I also experienced problems importing and displaying one dataset in Orange. I tried alternative files and checked their formats and columns.

### What I Learned
I learned how to compare datasets based on project requirements and use Orange to explore data before developing the application. I also learned the importance of agreeing on clear responsibilities within the team.

### Outcome
The group agreed on our roles, and we selected a suitable CSV dataset for the SalesInsight project.

